add_claim("Classic Players are DLS's analogue of FIFA Icons - black cards on their own tab, unlocked by playing the game a lot, rated from 85 up to 97, and sitting on the Prize Ladder.", 3, "cards/classic-players", [e_ct])
add_claim("Champions cards are players in their prime with high stats, obtainable only through a limited-time event consisting of opening Legendary Agents and hoping for luck.", 3, "cards/champions", [e_ct])
