add_claim("GACHA PROBABILITY MECHANIC: the chance of pulling a special player from a Legendary Agent depends on how many legendary players you currently own plus how many are in the transfer market, and THE PROBABILITY INCREASES THE FEWER LEGENDARY PLAYERS ARE LEFT TO PULL.", 2, "gacha/agent-probability-mechanic", [e_ct], notes="Highest-value collection finding of the sweep")
add_claim("The community method to raise agent pull odds: buy and sell every 80+ player you see so they sit in the recovery tab for two days, removing them from the agent pool - reported to take Champion odds to 100% for about 275,000 coins across ~145 players and 70+ market refreshes.", 2, "gacha/recovery-tab-method", [e_ct])
add_claim("Stacking gold players in the transfer market also blocks them from being pulled from agents, and LOCKING players helps raise the odds but costs gems.", 3, "gacha/market-stacking", [e_ct])
